\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O loving Lord, who art for ever seeking
\par Men of Thy mind, intent to do Thy will,
\par Strong in Thy strength, Thy power and grace bespeaking;
\par Faithful to Thee, through good report and ill-
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. To Thee we come, and humbly make confession,
\par Faithless so oft, in thought and word and deed,
\par Asking that we may have, in true possession,
\par Thy free forgiveness in the hour of need.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In duties small, be Thou our inspiration,
\par In large affairs endue us with Thy might;
\par Through faithful service cometh full salvation,
\par So may we serve, Thy will our chief delight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Not disobedient to the heavenly vision,
\par Faithful in all things, seeking not reward,
\par Then, following Thee, may we fulfil our mission,
\par True to ourselves, our brethren, and our Lord.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

